# DevOps

- Dockerfile should be multi-stage (build → minimal runtime image)
- Dev stack uses docker-compose (postgres, redis, bull board/mailhog as needed)
- CI/CD pipeline: lint → test → build (and e2e for critical flows)
- Validate env vars at startup (schema) — fail fast
- Keep services stateless; use Redis for session/queue when scaling horizontally

